1
00:00:01,930 --> 00:00:04,390
Shizuoka regional semi-finals.

2
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:08,510
Playing without the injured Wakabayashi, Nankatsu FC...

3
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:13,030
...faced Shimada FC, a team known for their strong defense.

4
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:15,900
Even though Tsubasa and the others dominated the game...

5
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:19,950
...Shimada scored after finding an opening.

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:28,630
After conceding a 2nd goal, Nankatsu found themselves in a hopeless situation.

7
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:32,760
However, Tsubasa didn't give up.

8
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:36,000
He overcame the opponent with his perfect passes...

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,680
...and managed to score the goal that would change the flow of the game.

10
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:42,880
Additionally, with goalkeeper Morisaki's efforts...

11
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:46,880
...Nankatsu FC was able to reach the finals.

12
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:56,440
Meanwhile, Meiwa FC also advanced to the finals with Hyuga Kojiro's return.

