Jump out onto the huge TV screen

36
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:19,180
Jump out onto the huge TV screen

37
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:34,420
Episode 12
Crushing Wakabayashi

38
00:02:30,420 --> 00:02:34,420
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

39
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:36,050
Push! Push! Shimizu!

40
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:39,550
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

41
00:02:40,170 --> 00:02:42,720
Look at those cheers.

42
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,450
The big day has finally arrived.

43
00:02:44,450 --> 00:02:46,430
The final match to determine the Shizuoka regional representative...

44
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:49,060
...that will participate in the National Youth Football Tournament.

45
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:53,000
Which team will earn the right to go to the national tournament?

46
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:56,790
Will it be Nankatsu FC, composed of players from last year's representative Shutetsu...

47
00:02:56,790 --> 00:03:02,570
...or the famous Shimizu FC, who have easily crushed their opponents so far?

48
00:03:02,570 --> 00:03:04,820
Alright, I'm ready.

49
00:03:05,290 --> 00:03:07,080
Is your leg okay?

50
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,500
Of course.

51
00:03:08,500 --> 00:03:11,410
How much longer were you expecting me to sit on the bench?

52
00:03:11,410 --> 00:03:16,340
Morisaki, you protected our goal very well yesterday. Thank you.

53
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:20,840
Leave Nankatsu's goal to me today.

54
00:03:22,110 --> 00:03:26,600
Do you understand? Our plan is to always mark Ozora Tsubasa.

55
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:29,940
Not just when he gets close to the goal; mark him at all times, and...

56
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:32,880
...absolutely prevent him from shooting, passing, or dribbling!

57
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:33,940
Okay!

58
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:36,040
I'm counting on you, Nakao, Takada.

59
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:37,860
- Okay.
- Leave it to us.

60
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:47,530
Both teams lined up on the field under the summer sun.

61
00:03:47,530 --> 00:03:50,450
The final match to decide the Shizuoka regional representative...

62
00:03:50,450 --> 00:03:54,250
...between Nankatsu FC and Shimizu FC was about to begin.

63
00:03:54,250 --> 00:03:56,630
I'm on the bench again?!

64
00:03:56,630 --> 00:04:00,140
Hey, Tsubasa! Do your best!

65
00:04:00,140 --> 00:04:04,560
Anego, the match hasn't even started yet. Calm down a bit.

66
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,040
Shut up!

67
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:08,460
Today is that important final match!

68
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:09,840
When else would I cheer--

69
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,420
Tsubasa-kun!

70
00:04:12,290 --> 00:04:16,680
What? Did someone else just cheer for Tsubasa-kun?

71
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,150
Of course there will be others.

72
00:04:18,150 --> 00:04:19,980
There are that many people here, after all.

73
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:23,990
I should be the only one cheering for Tsubasa-kun!

74
00:04:24,410 --> 00:04:27,700
Both teams have taken their positions.

75
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:30,740
Nankatsu FC will play their usual 4-3-3.

76
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:35,960
Their big trump cards are Tsubasa-kun, who has scored a hat trick in every match so far...

77
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:38,310
...and their goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun.

78
00:04:38,310 --> 00:04:43,210
Wakabayashi-kun couldn't play in the semi-finals and was waiting to enter the game.

79
00:04:43,210 --> 00:04:49,670
On the opposing team Shimizu FC, goalkeeper Kawakami-kun is very solid in defense...

80
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:51,900
...and they will play in a 4-4-2 formation.

81
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:54,130
They have players who can compete with Nankatsu FC.

82
00:04:54,130 --> 00:04:56,520
They swept through to the finals.

83
00:04:56,520 --> 00:05:00,720
Both teams scored about the same number of goals per game in the regional qualifiers.

84
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,310
Their strength is similar.

85
00:05:02,310 --> 00:05:05,900
It's fair to say it's impossible to predict how the match will go.

86
00:05:06,370 --> 00:05:09,070
If we win today, we'll go to the nationals.

87
00:05:09,070 --> 00:05:11,240
Let's go, Tsubasa-kun.

88
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:13,040
Yes.

89
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:17,710
The match begins with Nankatsu's kick-off.

90
00:05:18,270 --> 00:05:20,460
Misaki-kun gets the ball and runs.

91
00:05:21,290 --> 00:05:22,460
I won't allow it!

92
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:23,710
Taki-kun!

93
00:05:23,710 --> 00:05:27,380
Misaki-kun draws his opponent and makes a wonderful pass.

94
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:28,220
Tsubasa!

95
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:31,060
Will Nankatsu be able to get the ball to Tsubasa-kun?

96
00:05:32,500 --> 00:05:36,020
But two players from Shimizu are completely marking Tsubasa!

97
00:05:37,270 --> 00:05:38,520
Watch out, Taki!

98
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,690
I'm taking it!

99
00:05:39,690 --> 00:05:40,640
Oh no!

100
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,230
Shimizu FC gets the ball.

101
00:05:42,230 --> 00:05:43,610
Run, Kanda!

102
00:05:43,610 --> 00:05:46,190
Shimizu, having gotten the ball, launches a quick counter-attack.

103
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,910
Hey, over here!

104
00:05:47,910 --> 00:05:49,780
Kanda-kun runs into open space.

105
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:50,950
Fall back!

106
00:05:51,470 --> 00:05:52,320
Kanda!

107
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:54,160
A sideways long pass!

108
00:05:56,540 --> 00:05:58,160
I'll never allow it!

109
00:05:58,790 --> 00:06:00,960
Kanda-kun slips through.

110
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,480
That's to be expected from the famous Shimizu.

111
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,080
Every player is great in their position!

112
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:06,720
So will Kanda-kun try to get past Takasugi-kun?

113
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,510
You...

114
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:11,300
There's Obayashi-kun and Murakami-kun running directly in front of the goal!

115
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,320
Mark them!

116
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,320
I'll never allow it!

117
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:16,890
Kanda-kun passes. It's on Obayashi-kun.

118
00:06:18,590 --> 00:06:19,690
Take that!

119
00:06:19,690 --> 00:06:21,770
The first shot comes from Shimizu.

120
00:06:22,790 --> 00:06:23,770
Wakabayashi!

121
00:06:25,770 --> 00:06:27,740
Wakabayashi-kun rushes forward quickly!

122
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:30,860
An amazing save!

123
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,120
Nice save.

124
00:06:34,950 --> 00:06:37,870
That's it, my leg is healed. Tsubasa!

125
00:06:38,250 --> 00:06:40,120
He sends the ball far.

126
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:43,040
A pass to Nankatsu's ace forward, Tsubasa-kun.

127
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:46,130
However, there are two players marking Tsubasa-kun.

128
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,670
All three jump at the same time.

129
00:06:48,670 --> 00:06:54,300
Jumping the highest and getting the ball, as expected, is Nankatsu's number 10, Ozora Tsubasa-kun!

130
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:58,640
Misaki-kun returns the ball to Tsubasa-kun with a short touch.

131
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:00,660
Tsubasa-kun gets the ball and runs.

132
00:07:02,810 --> 00:07:04,770
Come on, Tsubasa-kun!

133
00:07:06,140 --> 00:07:06,900
Go!

134
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:10,440
Despite being marked, Tsubasa-kun fires a long shot!

135
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:14,780
It bounces off the post again.

136
00:07:14,780 --> 00:07:16,240
That was close...

137
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,780
Th-This kid...

138
00:07:17,780 --> 00:07:18,790
Amazing.

139
00:07:22,570 --> 00:07:23,670
Two players aren't enough.

140
00:07:23,670 --> 00:07:25,580
Mark him with 3 players.

141
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:28,810
Why is there a post there?

142
00:07:28,810 --> 00:07:30,300
Tsubasa-kun!

143
00:07:30,300 --> 00:07:33,630
What's wrong? You would have scored just now!

144
00:07:33,630 --> 00:07:35,790
W-Who is that girl?

145
00:07:35,790 --> 00:07:38,890
- A-Anego!
- Please wait!

146
00:07:38,890 --> 00:07:43,980
Tsubasa-kun! Did you forget me? It's me! Yayoi!

147
00:07:44,340 --> 00:07:46,560
I came to cheer for you!

148
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:52,360
Hey, look at me for a second!

149
00:07:52,930 --> 00:07:55,610
What kind of relationship do you have with Tsubasa-kun, huh?

150
00:07:56,490 --> 00:07:58,120
What about you?

151
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:03,610
I'm the captain of the Nankatsu Cheer... No, the Tsubasa Cheer Squad.

152
00:08:03,610 --> 00:08:07,520
Is that so? I'm Tsubasa-kun's friend from his previous school.

153
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:09,920
My name is Aoba Yayoi. Nice to meet you.

154
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:13,070
I-I'm from the cheer squad too. Nice to--

155
00:08:13,070 --> 00:08:14,930
You stay out of this!

156
00:08:15,710 --> 00:08:18,680
Tsubasa-kun always plays amazingly.

157
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,370
He's so dynamic.

158
00:08:23,550 --> 00:08:28,470
He always played with the ball alone at school.

159
00:08:28,470 --> 00:08:32,280
He'd come to school and play with the soccer ball every day.

160
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:36,280
But Tsubasa-kun is truly the best on the field.

161
00:08:37,230 --> 00:08:41,790
Everyone looked at Tsubasa-kun strangely because he played nothing but football.

162
00:08:41,790 --> 00:08:44,040
Is this kid an idiot or what?

163
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:49,240
I admired this passion for football in Tsubasa-kun.

164
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:51,500
Yayoi, we're going.

165
00:08:53,600 --> 00:09:00,010
Still, Tsubasa-kun transferred before I could confess my feelings to him.

166
00:09:01,070 --> 00:09:02,530
Aren't you going to cheer?

167
00:09:02,530 --> 00:09:04,700
Tsubasa-kun has the ball.

168
00:09:04,700 --> 00:09:05,350
What?

169
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:08,350
Tsubasa-kun received the pass.

170
00:09:10,570 --> 00:09:13,280
This time, 3 players are marking him.

171
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:14,530
Three?

172
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,030
We're marking him with three?

173
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,470
Exactly.

174
00:09:18,470 --> 00:09:22,540
But won't that weaken the defense?

175
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:23,950
No problem.

176
00:09:23,950 --> 00:09:29,750
Even if there's an opening in defense and others shoot, I'll save it.

177
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:33,140
Nankatsu only has him.

178
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:38,680
So if we mark Tsubasa, we won't lose.

179
00:09:39,630 --> 00:09:43,260
Tsubasa-kun is being marked by 3 players for the first time.

180
00:09:43,260 --> 00:09:45,850
With three from the famous Shimizu marking him...

181
00:09:45,850 --> 00:09:47,880
...Tsubasa-kun can't even move.

182
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:49,560
It must be hard for you, Tsubasa.

183
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:53,100
As your talents get recognized, your rivals increase.

184
00:09:53,100 --> 00:09:54,860
Tsubasa, over here!

185
00:09:55,810 --> 00:09:56,320
What?!

186
00:09:57,360 --> 00:10:00,850
Since all of you are marking Tsubasa, we're free.

187
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:01,780
Kisugi!

188
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:02,970
Got it.

189
00:10:02,970 --> 00:10:05,120
Nankatsu passes quickly.

190
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:09,580
Thanks to the opening created by Tsubasa-kun, the ball quickly reaches Kisugi-kun in front of the goal.

191
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:11,790
He shoots while unmarked!

192
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:14,750
Saved!

193
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,510
Nice catch, Captain!

194
00:10:18,250 --> 00:10:23,240
Shimizu's goalkeeper and captain, Kawakami-kun, jumps and makes a wonderful catch.

195
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:28,270
If Nankatsu has Wakabayashi, Shimizu has Kawakami.

196
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:34,020
That goalkeeper isn't bad at all.

197
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:36,020
Tsubasa-kun!

198
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:40,030
Whatever. We'll finish our conversation after the match is over.

199
00:10:40,030 --> 00:10:41,950
Forward!

200
00:10:44,790 --> 00:10:47,370
The match turned into a great struggle.

201
00:10:47,370 --> 00:10:48,910
Their strength is equal.

202
00:10:48,910 --> 00:10:53,460
They never give up. It's like a spectacle among champions.

203
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:55,170
Got it.

204
00:10:55,170 --> 00:10:58,130
Shimizu takes a quick mid-range shot.

205
00:10:59,340 --> 00:11:02,180
But Nankatsu has no intention of conceding.

206
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:08,310
Wakabayashi, who clearly prepared for this match, is in top form today.

207
00:11:09,300 --> 00:11:12,020
The whistle seemed to blow immediately, too.

208
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:15,020
The 20-minute first half is over. The score is still 0-0.

209
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:21,280
As long as I'm here, no ball will enter Nankatsu's goal.

210
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:23,780
Why are you exaggerating so much?

211
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:26,320
Then we have no other choice.

212
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:35,050
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

213
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,720
That's to be expected from Shimizu.

214
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:44,570
Yes.

215
00:11:44,570 --> 00:11:46,180
They're very tough nuts.

216
00:11:46,180 --> 00:11:48,480
Players worthy of a final match, aren't they?

217
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,430
Yes.

218
00:11:49,430 --> 00:11:52,680
I'm counting on you, everyone. One goal.

219
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:55,600
Scoring one goal is enough for us to win.

220
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,880
That might be true, but...

221
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:59,610
...Tsubasa will likely be marked in the second half too.

222
00:11:59,610 --> 00:12:02,690
Still, score the goal with your own strength.

223
00:12:02,690 --> 00:12:03,610
Okay!

224
00:12:03,610 --> 00:12:06,320
We've come this far. There's no way we can lose!

225
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:07,120
Yes!

226
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:09,270
We'll be the ones going to the nationals.

227
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:10,120
Yes.

228
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,760
Alright. Let's win this.

229
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:14,100
Yes!

230
00:12:14,100 --> 00:12:17,130
I will definitely score a goal in the second half.

231
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,050
Tsubasa...

232
00:12:19,630 --> 00:12:21,960
Yes, I'm counting on you, Tsubasa.

233
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,170
Okay.

234
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:27,930
We'll mark Tsubasa in the second half too.

235
00:12:27,930 --> 00:12:31,800
But if we can't score, we can't go to the nationals.

236
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:35,440
For that, we'll put our plan into action.

237
00:12:36,540 --> 00:12:38,610
We'll crush Wakabayashi!

238
00:12:39,340 --> 00:12:42,190
If we mark Tsubasa, the focal point of their attacks...

239
00:12:42,190 --> 00:12:47,360
...and crush Wakabayashi, the main pillar of their defense, victory will be ours.

240
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:51,620
Luckily, there's no way Wakabayashi's injury has completely healed.

241
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:55,780
Alright, let's go! We'll be the ones going to the nationals!

242
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:56,870
Yes!

243
00:13:00,490 --> 00:13:04,380
That's right. I was going to go talk to that girl after the half ended.

244
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:07,440
That girl was so cute!

245
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:10,480
To Anego, through thick and thin--

246
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:12,320
I can hear you.

247
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,700
Never mind that...

248
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,560
Nope.

249
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:18,590
Where did that girl go?

250
00:13:18,590 --> 00:13:20,860
Where could she have gone?

251
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:26,470
The second half has begun.

252
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:31,990
The first half ended 0-0.

253
00:13:31,990 --> 00:13:35,120
Will Shimizu or Nankatsu score the first goal?

254
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:38,120
Push! Push! Shimizu!

255
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:41,630
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

256
00:13:42,310 --> 00:13:45,640
Unlike the first half, Shimizu is passing carefully.

257
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:49,140
Are they trying to break through Nankatsu's defense?

258
00:13:49,530 --> 00:13:53,910
On the other hand, as in the first half, there are three players marking Tsubasa-kun.

259
00:13:53,910 --> 00:13:56,020
How stubborn they turned out to be!

260
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,940
Kishida, move a little to the left.

261
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:02,660
Alright, that's enough.

262
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:05,860
Nankatsu goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun directs the defense as usual.

263
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:09,730
Shall we begin now?

264
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:15,370
Suddenly, Shimizu sent a long ball towards the goal.

265
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:19,830
The entire team follows after it.

266
00:14:19,830 --> 00:14:22,460
The high ball began to descend towards the goal.

267
00:14:22,460 --> 00:14:23,750
Leave it to me!

268
00:14:23,750 --> 00:14:25,550
Wakabayashi-kun comes out.

269
00:14:28,130 --> 00:14:30,180
All of Shimizu is coming towards the ball.

270
00:14:30,430 --> 00:14:34,680
Wakabayashi-kun jumps! What incredible physical ability!

271
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:38,270
But Shimizu is still running towards the goal! This...

272
00:14:39,210 --> 00:14:40,520
They collided!

273
00:14:41,530 --> 00:14:42,020
What?!

274
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:47,070
Foul!

275
00:14:47,070 --> 00:14:48,840
What a play.

276
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:51,070
It's like they targeted the goalkeeper instead of the ball.

277
00:14:51,070 --> 00:14:55,080
Damn it! You did that on purpose, didn't you?

278
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,970
Sorry, okay?

279
00:14:56,970 --> 00:15:00,160
We are very determined to go to the nationals.

280
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,920
Are you okay?! Wakabayashi!

281
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:06,170
Of course. I won't be brought down by an attack like that!

282
00:15:06,170 --> 00:15:07,630
Wakabayashi-kun.

283
00:15:07,630 --> 00:15:10,000
Everyone, I'm counting on you for the first goal!

284
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,130
Okay!

285
00:15:12,190 --> 00:15:15,050
It seems Wakabayashi's leg has healed.

286
00:15:15,050 --> 00:15:18,140
The game will restart with Nankatsu's kick.

287
00:15:18,140 --> 00:15:19,240
Let's go!

288
00:15:23,770 --> 00:15:25,290
That was a bad kick.

289
00:15:25,290 --> 00:15:26,790
What happened, Wakabayashi-kun?!

290
00:15:26,790 --> 00:15:28,870
He can't get up!

291
00:15:28,870 --> 00:15:31,070
Wakabayashi-kun, your leg is again--

292
00:15:31,070 --> 00:15:32,590
Here's the chance! Attack!

293
00:15:32,590 --> 00:15:34,910
The second part of the plan succeeded!

294
00:15:34,910 --> 00:15:37,880
Get the ball! If they get it, we're finished!

295
00:15:38,640 --> 00:15:39,660
Damn it!

296
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:42,630
Kanda!

297
00:15:42,630 --> 00:15:44,420
Shimizu gets the ball!

298
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:45,290
Oh no!

299
00:15:45,290 --> 00:15:47,000
The first goal is ours!

300
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,840
A cross is coming.

301
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:49,840
Mine!

302
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:52,090
An injury like this...

303
00:15:52,540 --> 00:15:55,340
Even though he's injured, Wakabayashi-kun jumps!

304
00:15:56,160 --> 00:15:58,180
He lost his balance!

305
00:15:58,180 --> 00:16:00,640
Will the first goal be Shimizu's?!

306
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:04,100
No, it's not going in! Misaki-kun stops it!

307
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,610
You're the man, Misaki!

308
00:16:05,610 --> 00:16:08,860
But the danger isn't over! The ball goes to Kato-kun!

309
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:11,900
Alright, now take that!

310
00:16:12,380 --> 00:16:14,910
He shoots while Wakabayashi-kun can't move!

311
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:16,160
Can't he save it?!

312
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:17,280
It went in!

313
00:16:17,280 --> 00:16:20,370
Will Shimizu FC score the first goal?!

314
00:16:20,370 --> 00:16:24,210
Damn it! Don't underestimate Wakabayashi Genzo!

315
00:16:24,750 --> 00:16:29,710
He caught it! Wakabayashi-kun jumps with a last-ditch effort and catches it!

316
00:16:32,110 --> 00:16:34,380
Take that, Tsubasa!

317
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:37,250
Wakabayashi-kun kicks with his injured leg!

318
00:16:37,250 --> 00:16:38,970
It goes quite far.

319
00:16:38,970 --> 00:16:43,020
It's better to kick with my injured leg than with the leg I'm supporting myself on.

320
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:46,150
Tsubasa-kun received the pass!

321
00:16:46,510 --> 00:16:50,270
I won't let Wakabayashi-kun's effort be in vain!

322
00:16:50,270 --> 00:16:51,610
Don't let him pass!

323
00:16:51,610 --> 00:16:52,550
Tsubasa!

324
00:16:52,550 --> 00:16:53,820
I'm counting on you, trio!

325
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:59,330
No matter how many people try to mark him, Tsubasa-kun isn't someone who will stop.

326
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:05,410
In our first encounter, he single-handedly crushed our entire B team.

327
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:17,980
What?!

328
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:20,720
He got past all three in the blink of an eye!

329
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:25,590
As I promised, I'll score a goal this half, Wakabayashi-kun.

330
00:17:25,590 --> 00:17:28,480
Tsubasa! Finish it with a volley!

331
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:30,980
Tsubasa-kun shoots!

332
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:34,860
It went in!

333
00:17:35,340 --> 00:17:37,160
Nankatsu takes the lead.

334
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,360
I did it!

335
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:45,450
Catching an opening thanks to Wakabayashi-kun's huge efforts, Tsubasa-kun finally scores!

336
00:17:39,870 --> 00:17:41,700
You did it!

337
00:17:42,330 --> 00:17:43,700
He did it!

338
00:17:45,450 --> 00:17:47,520
Thank you, Tsubasa.

339
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:50,400
I will definitely protect this goal.

340
00:17:56,060 --> 00:17:57,550
Damn it!

341
00:17:57,550 --> 00:18:00,550
Push! Push! Shimizu!

342
00:18:00,550 --> 00:18:04,060
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

343
00:18:04,060 --> 00:18:06,060
Let's maintain the lead!

344
00:18:06,060 --> 00:18:08,020
Having come this far, we'll never lose!

345
00:18:09,690 --> 00:18:11,270
Kisugi-kun passes.

346
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:15,160
They're playing calmly and logically.

347
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,110
Tsubasa-kun!

348
00:18:16,110 --> 00:18:18,780
Misaki-kun sends the ball inside.

349
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:23,870
It went in!

350
00:18:23,870 --> 00:18:26,370
Nankatsu scored their 2nd goal!

351
00:18:26,370 --> 00:18:28,690
They got really fired up after the first goal!

352
00:18:28,690 --> 00:18:31,380
Nankatsu's attack can't be stopped!

353
00:18:32,330 --> 00:18:34,240
That's our Tsubasa!

354
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:36,850
See? Isn't Tsubasa-kun amazing?

355
00:18:36,850 --> 00:18:42,800
Yes. That was the main reason I came to watch the Shizuoka match.

356
00:18:44,510 --> 00:18:47,140
# Tokyo Musashino Field #

357
00:18:48,430 --> 00:18:49,910
Pass! Pass!

358
00:18:49,910 --> 00:18:51,440
Hey, over here!

359
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:54,340
No. Not here.

360
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:57,750
Hyuga-san, who did you come all this way to see?

361
00:18:57,750 --> 00:19:02,200
There were two people I wanted to see before the nationals.

362
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:06,700
One is Nankatsu FC's goalkeeper, Wakabayashi Genzo.

363
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:13,970
The second is the person called Misugi Jun from Tojo Academy Musashi FC.

364
00:19:13,970 --> 00:19:15,910
What kind of person is he?

365
00:19:15,910 --> 00:19:22,020
Misugi? Nicknamed the Ace of the Field, a prodigy player who can play anywhere.

366
00:19:22,020 --> 00:19:23,510
Tsubasa-kun!

367
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:27,890
He caught it! Shimizu's shot doesn't go in!

368
00:19:29,280 --> 00:19:33,060
Even though his leg is injured, Wakabayashi-kun protects the goal with everything he has.

369
00:19:33,060 --> 00:19:37,780
Only 1 minute left for Nankatsu, who are up by two goals, to win the match.

370
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:41,360
Everyone, don't let your guard down until the last moment! Tsubasa!

371
00:19:41,850 --> 00:19:46,370
Nankatsu sends the ball to their ace forward, Tsubasa-kun!

372
00:19:46,370 --> 00:19:48,200
Crush through! There's no time left!

373
00:19:50,250 --> 00:19:52,080
There's an opening.

374
00:19:56,910 --> 00:19:58,260
Inside!

375
00:19:58,260 --> 00:20:01,190
Tsubasa-kun's shot near the post becomes the 3rd goal!

376
00:20:02,750 --> 00:20:04,890
The final whistle blew too!

377
00:20:04,890 --> 00:20:08,180
Nankatsu wins 3-0!

378
00:20:08,180 --> 00:20:09,430
We did it!

379
00:20:09,430 --> 00:20:13,190
The team that will represent the Shizuoka region at the nationals...

380
00:20:13,190 --> 00:20:15,440
...will be Nankatsu FC!

381
00:20:16,070 --> 00:20:19,760
With that last goal, Tsubasa-kun...

382
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:24,520
...has achieved a hat trick in every match of the regional tournament.

383
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:27,240
You score perfect goals.

384
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:34,520
In the end, we couldn't stop either Tsubasa or Wakabayashi.

385
00:20:34,520 --> 00:20:36,140
There was nothing we could do.

386
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:39,590
They were better than us in every move.

387
00:20:40,330 --> 00:20:42,880
We truly lost.

388
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:48,890
Tsubasa! Do your best at the nationals as the Shizuoka representative!

389
00:20:49,670 --> 00:20:52,640
Kawakami-kun... Okay!

390
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:55,020
They did it, Anego!

391
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:56,040
Yes.

392
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:59,760
Tsubasa-kun! Congratulations on your victory!

393
00:20:59,760 --> 00:21:01,150
Her again!

394
00:21:01,150 --> 00:21:04,400
Let's meet at the nationals next time!

395
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:10,410
I also transferred and am currently the manager of Tokyo representative Musashi FC!

396
00:21:11,550 --> 00:21:13,180
That boy...

397
00:21:13,180 --> 00:21:15,120
Coach, do you know him?

398
00:21:15,690 --> 00:21:21,720
Misugi Jun. Currently one of the most well-known prospective players among young footballers.

399
00:21:22,430 --> 00:21:24,080
Misugi Jun.

400
00:21:24,760 --> 00:21:26,880
See you!

401
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:29,260
A manager, huh.

402
00:21:29,260 --> 00:21:33,250
Then I should become the manager of Nankatsu FC!

403
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:33,960
What?

404
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:37,670
That way, I can also go to the nationals with Tsubasa-kun!

405
00:21:37,670 --> 00:21:38,520
Yes!

406
00:21:39,660 --> 00:21:46,360
As the day ended, Nankatsu FC became the winner of the Shizuoka regional tournament...

407
00:21:48,410 --> 00:21:56,370
...and Wangan Football Stadium was waiting for the young players who would come to play football from across the nation.

408
00:22:01,380 --> 00:22:03,380
You did it, Tsubasa.

409
00:22:03,380 --> 00:22:04,760
Yes.

410
00:22:04,760 --> 00:22:06,880
Now it's time for the nationals.

411
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:09,920
The real difficulty will begin now.

412
00:22:09,920 --> 00:22:10,680
Yes.

413
00:22:11,090 --> 00:22:12,350
Alright.

414
00:22:13,360 --> 00:22:18,570
When I win the nationals, I'll go with Roberto to the football country, Brazil!

